{"title":"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 96","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Note\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Note</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f14c16b5d5a9f18e096d5576fa86d478a02eaf24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=90^\\circ, \\angle B=60^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/ccc55f85ae3c39ddd90ace7764a57bce879351c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=8$\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />, and a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is chosen inside the triangle. The interior angle bisectors <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f52e1dadaaa21d33f911932a53c305bf8ba557.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_A, \\ell_B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/5/3856ff459e8e0f763e995fae8680728ba30beef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> of respective angles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1ce6ff651bc6a34e7c35bf7b7afe7aae51b894fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PAB, PBC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/f/aefb546771b9e006905c1e8147a11084b1366fff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PCA$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> intersect pairwise at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/403d14170041919f9343e6f3144407fce32eca0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=\\ell_A\\cap\\ell_C, Y=\\ell_A\\cap\\ell_B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"201\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/49520157c2d7a78f9ae2f5aaf24b59bc26c59698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z=\\ell_B\\cap\\ell_C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. If triangles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/2/0526e1f5ad1412706cf938657f754604e672a671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XYZ$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> are directly similar, then the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/3/3039f01ba9e41f5490b7130e344be554015a25b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle XYZ$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> may be written in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/2/012f93367868548db0d398dde89aeff5adc669e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{p\\sqrt q-r\\sqrt s}t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"60\" height=\"25\" />, where<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96c025187a325a4eff1c631bf795c50ee09ab0a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p,q,r,s,t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> are positive integers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are not divisible by the square of any prime, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/6361a4ffaae47889849338bf47309de3a931cf75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(t,r,p)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"18\" />. Compute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/6/de6cc6fcb5cbb554a353842ffeb73d836cf14453.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q+r+s+t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"131\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2008_iTest_Problem_96.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/4a/2008_iTest_Problem_96.png/300px-2008_iTest_Problem_96.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"279\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/4a/2008_iTest_Problem_96.png/450px-2008_iTest_Problem_96.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/4/4a/2008_iTest_Problem_96.png/600px-2008_iTest_Problem_96.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1eda6e1d184dd6d4c589f1c475d56da1342eac45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\angle BAY$\" width=\"89\" height=\"13\" />. With some angle chasing, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/f/c4f03d024127db6633113f80af4b81c830c4d5fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle PBC = \\angle PCA = 2x$\" width=\"178\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/427519629b623291ae028a36c5b7c3eaa1d3b227.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APC = 90^\\circ$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/5/075a2b92ce32fc023fda6b4de0821ebeee519c66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APB = 120^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"112\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/b/58bff454649e367f844dccb368ecabed45515174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BPC = 150^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"113\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nBy using 30-60-90 triangles, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/0/ed01348eee5654fb7a4f56f462d723207631597f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = 8\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/0/830de927bd8077aa97abc0e3829961d12711fe7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Sines\" title=\"Law of Sines\">Law of Sines</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/f/90f6a92b773f52f528b404bd0d2712a65f105073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle APB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/c/fac056ce386c7154c5ed723c55b2808cc0357fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BPC$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98bb6fe00b8954376b984bb6ea77e6954274ac1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{8}{\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}} = \\tfrac{BP}{\\sin(2x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"90\" height=\"27\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/e/1be443c8d7db655f3d9e29dac6d9a480028c851b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{BP}{\\sin(30-2x)} = \\tfrac{16}{\\frac12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"108\" height=\"25\" />. After solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f874b39870586f0504f50a667f2bafedddf47904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> in both equations, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/a/ecaffeafb0f1f473354299db7095246785edf640.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{16}{\\sqrt{3}} \\sin(2x) &amp;= 32 \\left( \\frac12 \\cos(2x) - \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} \\sin(2x) \\right) \\\\ \\frac{\\sin(2x)}{\\sqrt{3}} &amp;= \\cos(2x) - \\sqrt{3} \\sin(2x) \\\\ \\frac{4\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\left( \\sin(2x) \\right) &amp;= \\cos(2x) \\\\ \\tan(2x) &amp;= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{4}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"361\" height=\"199\" />\nThus, by using identities, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/5188fc6ce5b284a8d28d53e42a8773f6324fbd7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{19 - 4\\sqrt{19}}{19}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"176\" height=\"53\" />. Now we will determine the length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bb2419be49ff83cbed7db9a2f366858ccabf2e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZ$\" width=\"30\" height=\"12\" />. We will only substitute <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/1/081bf0417da2140657aad909a14ca6c3ff8b77d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"18\" /> at the very end (along with the other trigonometric expressions) to keep calculations simple.\n</p><p><br />\nUsing the definition of a cosine, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/3/2636e7f2ee9b92f5796eb86b4c94085c447f5004.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XC = 8\\sqrt{3} \\cos(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"138\" height=\"21\" />. By the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Law_of_Sines\" title=\"Law of Sines\">Law of Sines</a> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/7/38726d4092da264ae84bef73ea18513b96728de9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BZC$\" width=\"58\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/7/0a7f35e4789985c2f46c82c27d005ffcfc1d1a59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{16}{\\frac12} = \\tfrac{ZC}{\\sin(x)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"82\" height=\"27\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/8/7881aa5424597d7d33dd416455964bef663fc731.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ZC = 32 \\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/4/b242354bc26e25ca0c88f3717f03c8b4eff237ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZ = 8\\sqrt{3} \\cos(x) - 32 \\sin(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"228\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nWe know that the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/0/bb091bfa9be998f89ca94c53b39b17e531a62d76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$32\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/7/c27e78f34b3cae4eb06b693ac1458708811de3e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XZ/AC = \\frac{8\\sqrt{3} \\cos(x) - 32 \\sin(x)}{8\\sqrt{3}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"272\" height=\"45\" /> Therefore,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/380d23334c4f63ef0c3ed9839a3011b0071ab26a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} [XYZ] &amp;= 32\\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\frac{64 \\cdot 3 \\cos^2 (x) - 16 \\cdot 32\\sqrt{3} \\sin(x) \\cos(x) + 32^2 \\sin^2 (x)}{64 \\cdot 3} \\\\ &amp;= \\sqrt{3} \\left( \\frac{96 \\cos^2 (x) - 256\\sqrt{3} \\sin(x) \\cos(x) + 32 \\cdot 16 \\sin^2 (x)}{3} \\right) \\\\ &amp;= 16\\sqrt{3} \\left( \\frac{26 \\sin^2 (x) - 8\\sqrt{3} \\sin(2x) + 6}{3} \\right) \\\\ &amp;= 16\\sqrt{3} \\left( \\frac{26(\\frac{19-4\\sqrt{19}}{38}) - 8\\sqrt{3} \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{19}} + 6}{3} \\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{16\\sqrt{3}}{3} \\left( 13 - \\frac{52\\sqrt{19}}{19} - \\frac{24\\sqrt{19}}{19} + 6 \\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{16\\sqrt{3}}{3} ( 19 - 4\\sqrt{19} ) \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{304\\sqrt{3} - 64\\sqrt{57}}{3} \\end{align*}\" width=\"537\" height=\"379\" />\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/0/cd07a7b7af135b91df26bb0cf2ac6a76ce744afb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p+q+r+s+t = \\boxed{431}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Note\">Note</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Note\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The original problem says that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/17759a97ba0c949a6e42e3f59281d8bc369873a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X=\\ell_A\\cap\\ell_B, Y=\\ell_B\\cap\\ell_C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/1/7f1095eb1e8ae06af58501906518cc17ec18a186.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z=\\ell_C\\cap\\ell_A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />. This is a typo.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_96&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest\" title=\"2008 iTest\">2008 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_95\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 95\">Problem 95</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_97\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 97\">Problem 97</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2008 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti